Z||000001||fierov8||12-06-2000||01:30 PM||||Haze,<P>I have the blank panel, and I know of someone who has a set of Vette Taillights.  All that would be needed would be to cut the panel and make the pockets for the taillights to sit in.<P>To see the blank panel, see:<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/ViewPhoto?u=220465&a=8653601&p=33333464" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/ViewPhoto?u=220465&a=8653601&p=33333464</A> <P><BR>I'll have to see if the guy that had the taillights still has them.  They are GM OEM parts, the lenses and the chromed backs.<P>I want $75 for the panel, I think the local guy wanted $50 for all 4 lenses.  Let me know if you are interested -- i'll coordinate all the shipping locally up to you if interested.  <P>lateron,<P>-jeffd<BR>Fort Worth, TX<P>||||reg||6
